    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University's Working Group for Women (WGW) organised a multidisciplinary research seminar on October 5, 2010 to highlight and discuss issues of violence against women; sexual and reproductive health and rights; and the challenges confronting women in emergencies during natural or man-made calamities.",
